        "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness.jsonld#process/Process_MergeTrain/node/Start_Override"
      ],
      "summary": "Land the ready pull requests as one train: place each by the merge-priority decision table, merge the members with `merge-base`, run the gate set on the combination, and on red eject the culprit rather than reject the train."
